# Ignore everything by default
*

# Re-include the docs tree so git descends into it. A negated file has no
# effect while its parent directory is still ignored, so the directories
# themselves must be un-ignored before the files inside them.
!/docs/
!/docs/**/

# Keep the docs we actually want to track
!/docs/**/*.md
!/docs/llms.txt
!/.gitignore
!/README.md